# JSON files in data directories (keep results/ and configs/ unaffected)
data/**/*.json

# NOTE: results/raw/*.json is intentionally NOT ignored and MUST be
# committed to git for every real experimental run, going forward. Raw
# results were never gitignored, but were also never committed in practice
# — that workflow gap, not a technical exclusion, is what let a compiled
# table's provenance become unverifiable (see results/EXPERIMENT_LOG.md).
# git history is what makes provenance provable later; HF/checkpoints are
# for large artifacts, not for the small per-config raw JSON files.

